/P 198 0 R
/T (This report covers the problem definition, campus graph design, navigation agent, destination lookup, route-search algorithm, implementation modules, illustrative interface, and reproducible evaluation. Its technical core is a JavaScript reference implementation of A* with a binary heap, together with a Dijkstra comparison obtained by disabling the heuristic.)
/E (This report covers the problem definition, campus graph design, navigation agent, destination lookup, route-search algorithm, implementation modules, illustrative interface, and reproducible evaluation. Its technical core is a JavaScript reference implementation of A* with a binary heap, together with a Dijkstra comparison obtained by disabling the heuristic.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
