/E (The demonstration dataset contains ten locations and sixteen bidirectional walkways. Coordinates and distances are chosen for teaching the algorithm. They should not be used as actual distances or directions on the Woxsen campus. Replacing the teaching graph with verified campus data is a separate deployment step.)
