/E (Users specify a starting point rather than relying on a live location sensor. The current design supports a single requested destination, distance-based routing, a step-free option, and temporary edge closures. A place resolver accepts configured names and aliases. It does not interpret every possible sentence or perform unrestricted conversational understanding.)
