/T (The AI component is goal-directed search. The system takes the goal location, reasons over legal transitions, evaluates candidate partial routes, and returns a path. A* uses both the distance already travelled and an estimate of the remaining distance. This is classical artificial intelligence and does not require a trained neural network [3].)
/E (The AI component is goal-directed search. The system takes the goal location, reasons over legal transitions, evaluates candidate partial routes, and returns a path. A* uses both the distance already travelled and an estimate of the remaining distance. This is classical artificial intelligence and does not require a trained neural network [3].)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
