/P 204 0 R
/T (Both methods relax outgoing edges: if reaching a neighbor through the current node gives a smaller distance, the stored best cost and predecessor are updated. A priority queue chooses the next entry. Old queue entries must be ignored when a later entry contains a better cost for the same node.)
/E (Both methods relax outgoing edges: if reaching a neighbor through the current node gives a smaller distance, the stored best cost and predecessor are updated. A priority queue chooses the next entry. Old queue entries must be ignored when a later entry contains a better cost for the same node.)
