/P 212 0 R
/T (For stronger numerical verification, a separate Floyd-Warshall calculation supplies the minimum distance for every ordered pair of locations. A* and Dijkstra are compared with that oracle on the base graph, the step-free graph, a graph with C-L closed, and a graph with all Library connections closed. Ten starts times ten goals times four configurations gives 400 cases.)
/E (For stronger numerical verification, a separate Floyd-Warshall calculation supplies the minimum distance for every ordered pair of locations. A* and Dijkstra are compared with that oracle on the base graph, the step-free graph, a graph with C-L closed, and a graph with all Library connections closed. Ten starts times ten goals times four configurations gives 400 cases.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [4]
>>
