/E (Indoor guidance and device positioning require additional engineering. GPS accuracy alone may not identify the correct doorway or floor. These capabilities should be added with their own validation rather than inferred from the success of the graph-search tests. The current report therefore provides a verified planning core, an implementation design, and a concrete next-step evaluation plan. It does not treat illustrative interface drawings as evidence of a field-tested navigation service.)
