2783 0 obj
<<
/Title (The main learning from preparing the report is that a shortest route is useful only when the map is accurate, the destination is understood, and the selected walkways satisfy the user's needs. These concerns shaped the implementation and the future development plan.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2386 0 R
/Prev 2889 0 R
/Next 2586 0 R
>>
endobj
2784 0 obj
<<
/Title (Finding a classroom, laboratory, library, hostel, or auditorium can be difficult for new students and visitors on a large campus. A static map shows locations but does not automatically choose a connected walking route or respond to a closed walkway. AI Campus Navigation and Routers addresses this problem through a goal-based route-finding system.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2587 0 R
/Next 2890 0 R
>>
endobj
