/Title (Campus navigation is a useful Foundations of AI problem because it connects a clear goal with a representation of the environment and a sequence of actions. The goal is to reach a selected destination. The environment is a network of known campus locations and permitted walking connections. The actions are movements along those connections. A search procedure selects a route that satisfies the goal and the stated constraints [1], [2].)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2978 0 R
/Prev 2996 0 R
/Next 2997 0 R
>>
endobj
3021 0 obj
