3022 0 obj
<<
/Title (Users specify a starting point rather than relying on a live location sensor. The current design supports a single requested destination, distance-based routing, a step-free option, and temporary edge closures. A place resolver accepts configured names and aliases. It does not interpret every possible sentence or perform unrestricted conversational understanding.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2980 0 R
/Prev 3021 0 R
/Next 3001 0 R
>>
