3023 0 obj
<<
/Title (The AI component is goal-directed search. The system takes the goal location, reasons over legal transitions, evaluates candidate partial routes, and returns a path. A* uses both the distance already travelled and an estimate of the remaining distance. This is classical artificial intelligence and does not require a trained neural network [3].)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3001 0 R
/Next 3049 0 R
>>
endobj
