3135 0 obj
<<
/Title (A real map needs an owner, date, and method for recording closures. Changes should preserve stable identifiers and distinguish permanent geometry edits from temporary restrictions. A navigation result should identify the map snapshot on which it depends. Evaluation should also record errors explicitly. A no-route outcome can be correct when the destination is isolated. It should not be counted as an algorithm failure unless a permitted route actually exists. This distinction keeps the results interpretable.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3107 0 R
/Prev 3134 0 R
>>
