/Title (The system is organized into input, map preparation, reasoning, and output layers. The input layer records the user request. Map preparation supplies a consistent graph snapshot and removes prohibited edges. The reasoning layer computes a route. The output layer presents the same route as a map highlight and a sequence of instructions.)
